    <briefdescription>
<para>Wave D Phase 2B: High-cardinality metrics collection with bounded memory. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>2.4.0 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2026-08-17</para>
</simplesect>
Extends MetricsCollector with shard histograms, replica-lag quantiles, and retry counters. Enforces cardinality bounds to prevent OOM under high-volume metric emission.</para>
<para>Wave D Phase 2B Gate: W4A-METRICS-01 (memory bounded, no OOM at 50k dimensions)</para>
<sect1 id="wave__d__high__cardinality__metrics_8h_1autotoc_md21_1s1"><sect2 id="wave__d__high__cardinality__metrics_8h_1autotoc_md21">
<title>Cardinality Bounds</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>shard_latency{shard_id}</computeroutput>: max dimensions = cluster topology size (≤ 1024)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>replica_lag_ms{replica_id}</computeroutput>: max dimensions = replica set size (≤ 32)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>retry_counter{reason}</computeroutput>: max dimensions = enumerated failure reasons (≤ 10)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Total high-cardinality metrics: ≤ 50k unique label combinations</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Memory budget: ≤ 512 MB at 50k cardinality</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="test__high__cardinality__metrics_8cpp" kindref="compound">tests/observability/test_high_cardinality_metrics.cpp</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
</sect2></sect1>
